### ============================================
### HTTPException & Custom Exception Handling
### ============================================

### 1. Get existing item
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/foo

###

### 2. Get existing item with custom error-header support
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items-header/foo

###

### 3. Get existing unicorn
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/unicorns/charlie

###

### ============================================
### Error Cases
### ============================================

### 4. Item not found - expect 404
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/bar

###

### 5. Item not found with custom header - expect 404
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items-header/bar

###

### 6. Custom UnicornException - expect 418
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/unicorns/yolo